==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 4.67~6.67 seconds<sup>140f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4.67~6.67 seconds<sup>140f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*6 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A generic peon spam stage with occasional support from Sir Rel and a limited number of the main Angel/Traitless threats. Units like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]], [[Hitman Cat|Hitman]] and [[Mushroom Cat|Mushroom]] do wonders here, whether for clearing out peons or for dealing with the enemies that don't die from a single gust of wind. [[Awakened Bahamut Cat|Awakened Bahamut]] should be reserved for dealing significant damage to the Gokurakkos.

